text: ['All Sliver creatures get +1/+1 for each other Sliver on the battlefield.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Chalice of the Void enters the battlefield with X charge counters on it.\\nWhenever a player casts a spell with mana value equal to the number of charge counters on Chalice of the Void, counter that spell.', "Commander ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, Return an unblocked attacker you control to hand: Put this card onto the battlefield from your hand or the command zone tapped and attacking.)\\nWhenever a Ninja you control deals combat damage to a player, reveal the top card of your library and put that card into your hand. Each opponent loses life equal to that card's mana value.", 'Metalcraft — {T}: Add one mana of any color. Activate only if you control three or more artifacts.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, create a 1/1 white Monk creature token with prowess.', '{T}: Add one mana of any type that a land you control could produce.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1, then you may reveal the top card of your library. If a basic land card is revealed this way, put it onto the battlefield tapped. Activate only if an opponent controls at least two more lands than you.']
flavor: ['"The past does not determine our present."', 'Does it reflect the future that once was or the past that can never be?', 'Hanna was astounded. Mirri read every leaf and wisp of breeze like a book of ancient lore.', 'Hidden within the clicking, chittering swarm is a unique mind, still young, but growing more aware as time passes.', 'The suns of Mirrodin have shone upon perfection only once.']
